# Settings of this machine for the tests that read real games and for the
# progress statistics. Copy to local/games.conf (local/ is not in git) and
# fill in your own path:
#
#   mkdir -p local && cp scripts/games.conf.example local/games.conf
#
# Bash syntax: the file is sourced by `make test` and read by progress/progress.py.

# Folder with your game folders (each holding eboot.bin and sce_sys/). Tests
# that need a specific game look for it here by title ID and skip without it;
# progress/progress.py reads the imports of every eboot.bin under it.
GAMES_DIR=""
